others, but to correct your own defects.

152
00:21:43,991 --> 00:21:45,810
So they say, “Oh, this man is no good.

153
00:21:45,810 --> 00:21:46,861
That man is no good.

154
00:21:46,861 --> 00:21:47,951
This is wrong.”

155
00:21:47,951 --> 00:21:50,161
They start creating problems, you see.

156
00:21:50,161 --> 00:21:54,800
They’ll talk to each other, saying, “Oh
this man is not good.

157
00:21:54,800 --> 00:21:58,701
