179
00:24:15,381 --> 00:24:18,081
“Yes, it is wrong with me.

180
00:24:18,081 --> 00:24:19,151
So what should I do?

181
00:24:19,151 --> 00:24:20,361
How can I improve myself?”

182
00:24:20,361 --> 00:24:23,271
Ask the leader or you can write to Me or do
